{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And the band of its ephod.</b> Like a belt — and so it is stated of it: ויחגור אותו בחשב האפוד." "<b>Which is on it.</b> Over the face of the entire circumference of the ephod, the work of the band was visible, protruding and standing out, like a single belt above the rest of the work of the ephod, like the work of the neck of the robe. That is <b>which is on it</b> — meaning, on the ephod." "<b>Of it it shall be, etc.</b> In the order as I explained above, until 'and they descend from its two shoulders a little, toward the face of the ephod.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:49.627351284Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}